Licensing of the Quassel backend
================================

Engine/ and Transport/ (and Tests/Fixtures/quassel_mockcore.py in this
repository) are third-party files from iQuassel:

- the Quassel protocol engine of iQuassel by Woboq GmbH and contributors,
  https://github.com/woboq/iquassel
- its GNUstep port, including the socket in Transport/ and the mock core,
  by pkgdemon, https://github.com/pkgdemon/iquassel/tree/gnustep-native
  (commit d066f517e4c46008420dc39c7d55fafd0913d811)

The files carry the notice "Dual-Licensed, GPLv3 and Woboq GmbH's private
license. See file LICENSE". The upstream license statement,
https://github.com/pkgdemon/iquassel/blob/gnustep-native/LICENSE, releases
them under the GNU General Public License version 3.0 and, as an
alternative, lets Woboq GmbH (Berlin, Germany) or its successors publish
them on their own terms. That alternative is available to Woboq GmbH only.

Messages uses and distributes these files under the GNU General Public
License version 3 only (SPDX: GPL-3.0-only); the full text is in COPYING.
Every file changed for Messages says so in a comment at its top.

The other files of this bundle (Backend/, the GNUmakefiles, *Info.plist)
were written for Messages and are licensed "BSD-2-Clause OR
GPL-3.0-or-later". Because Quassel.msgbackend is built from the GPL files
above, the bundle as a whole, and any build of Messages.app that includes
